{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 12 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">去噪与图像恢复：残差、盲点与长程建模的假设边界</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Denoising &amp; Restoration</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_114_red_net-title\">RED-Net</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">相较普通 autoencoder，RED-Net 在每个镜像卷积—反卷积层之间建立对称加法 skip，而不只保留少数 U-Net 尺度跳连。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Deep symmetric convolutional–deconvolutional autoencoder connected by layer-by-layer additive residual skip connections at every mirrored depth.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">含噪、压缩或受退化影响的图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Noisy, blurry, or low-dose degraded image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">恢复后的高质量图像或残差校正图</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Restored clean image recovered via multi-depth additive residual shortcuts</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figures 1 and 2 · PDF pp.3 and 4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://papers.nips.cc/paper_files/paper/2016/hash/0ed9422357395a0d4879191c66f4faa2-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_114_red_net')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_114_red_net')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"RED-Net original paper architecture figure, Figures 1 and 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/1936be72753e83a3d3a9.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figures 1 and 2 · PDF pp.3 and 4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 7 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_114_red_net', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_114_red_net\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_114_red_net')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_114_red_net', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_114_red_net\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">退化图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">去噪、去块或超分等恢复输入</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests noisy, blurry, or low-dose degraded image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"去噪、去块或超分等恢复输入\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests noisy, blurry, or low-dose degraded image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"退化图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_114_red_net', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">退化图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">去噪、去块或超分等恢复输入</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests noisy, blurry, or low-dose degraded image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"连续卷积与 ReLU 扩大感受野并压缩局部信息\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes convolution encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"深卷积 encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"convolution encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_114_red_net', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">深卷积 encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">convolution encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">连续卷积与 ReLU 扩大感受野并压缩局部信息</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes convolution encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"包含退化上下文但细节传递路径较长\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs feature within the core symmetric conv deconv residual autoencoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"深层语义特征\" data-node-name-en=\"feature\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_114_red_net', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">深层语义特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">feature</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">包含退化上下文但细节传递路径较长</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs feature within the core symmetric conv deconv residual autoencoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐层重建空间分辨率与图像结构\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs transposed convolution decoder within the core symmetric conv deconv residual autoencoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"镜像反卷积 decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"transposed convolution decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_114_red_net', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">镜像反卷积 decoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">transposed convolution decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐层重建空间分辨率与图像结构</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs transposed convolution decoder within the core symmetric conv deconv residual autoencoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"encoder 第 i 层直接加到镜像 decoder 层，传递边缘并改善梯度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs symmetric skip additions within the core symmetric conv deconv residual autoencoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"对称 skip additions\" data-node-name-en=\"symmetric skip additions\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_114_red_net', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">对称 skip additions</span><span class=\"lang-en\">symmetric skip additions</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">encoder 第 i 层直接加到镜像 decoder 层，传递边缘并改善梯度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs symmetric skip additions within the core symmetric conv deconv residual autoencoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"融合深层上下文和浅层高频特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies reconstruction to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"重建层\" data-node-name-en=\"reconstruction\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_114_red_net', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">重建层</span><span class=\"lang-en\">reconstruction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">融合深层上下文和浅层高频特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies reconstruction to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"以像素级监督训练的最终输出\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces restored clean image recovered via multi-depth additive residual shortcuts via Stage 07.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"恢复图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 07\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_114_red_net', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">恢复图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 07</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">以像素级监督训练的最终输出</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces restored clean image recovered via multi-depth additive residual shortcuts via Stage 07.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"RED-Net Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 对称卷积—反卷积与跨层残差重建</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Symmetric Mirrored Convolution–Deconvolution Autoencoder with Dense Additive Skips</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"RED-Net：核心公式 · 对称卷积—反卷积与跨层残差重建\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"114\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"12.038701pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.613269 -69.000129 252.791775 12.038701\" width=\"252.791775pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><use id=\"m114_g20-94\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g17-94\"></use><path d=\"M4.744351-1.042169L4.61532-1.161274C4.079348-.486346 3.960242-.377166 3.801436-.377166C3.712107-.377166 3.642629-.456569 3.642629-.555824C3.642629-.665003 3.801436-1.280379 3.970168-1.796501C4.267931-2.72949 4.446588-3.463972 4.446588-3.712107C4.446588-4.109124 4.178602-4.37711 3.79151-4.37711C3.146358-4.37711 2.441653-3.731958 1.518589-2.282847L2.70964-6.729435L2.660012-6.779062C2.084338-6.650031 1.697247-6.580553 1.101722-6.511075V-6.362194C1.151349-6.362194 1.210901-6.362194 1.270454-6.362194C1.518589-6.362194 1.766725-6.342343 1.766725-6.123984C1.766725-5.895699 1.607918-5.379578 1.528515-5.081815L.188583 0H.932989C1.330006-1.528515 1.459037-1.865979 1.856053-2.47143C2.372175-3.255538 3.047104-3.870914 3.394494-3.870914C3.543375-3.870914 3.672405-3.751809 3.672405-3.622778C3.672405-3.583077 3.642629-3.454046 3.602927-3.295239L3.057029-1.240677C2.927999-.754332 2.858521-.446644 2.858521-.327539C2.858521-.069478 3.027253 .089329 3.295239 .089329C3.801436 .089329 4.1389-.178658 4.7443