ink:href=\"#m114_g10-62\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"84.688588\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g7-3\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"91.843917\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g13-51\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"97.064342\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g17-48\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"101.198832\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g13-150\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"115.621363\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g7-76\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"123.282624\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g17-82\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"128.133534\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g17-69\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"132.577173\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g17-68\" y=\"-58.49319\"></use><use x=\"141.093534\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g1-61\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"150.695236\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g7-107\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"156.3814\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g20-94\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"155.178423\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g13-71\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"162.298861\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g7-0\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"170.848963\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g13-71\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"176.25368\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g7-107\" y=\"-59.987571\"></use><use x=\"180.736866\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g17-50\" y=\"-64.102131\"></use><use x=\"180.736866\" xlink:href=\"#m114_g17-50\" y=\"-56.961428\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">早期浅层去噪/超分模型感受野有限，深层编解码器易丢局部信息</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Deep convolutional autoencoders lost fine spatial details through bottleneck compression and suffered from vanishing gradients.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">深卷积 encoder-decoder 通过对称 skip 连接重建高频图像细节</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pair every convolutional encoding layer with a mirrored deconvolutional decoding layer linked by an element-wise additive residual skip.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">把卷积与反卷积层镜像连接，改善梯度和细节传递</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Preserves full spatial resolution options and shortens backpropagation paths across 10–30+ layer restoration autoencoders.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">启发 CT/MRI 去噪、低剂量恢复和残差式重建网络</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Popularized residual encoder–decoder (RED-CNN) architectures as a primary baseline for low-dose CT image-domain denoising.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">历史恢复基线；缺显式成像物理与现代注意力建模</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Historically influential in low-dose CT denoising; purely image-domain L2 training can still over-smooth low-contrast liver lesions.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">encoder 用深卷积获取大感受野，decoder 用反卷积恢复图像。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">同尺度对称 skip 以加法传递高频细节并缩短反向传播路径。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">网络直接学习退化到 clean 的端到端映射，可按任务调整深度与输出残差。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Pair every convolutional encoding layer with a mirrored deconvolutional decoding layer linked by an element-wise additive residual skip.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Preserves full spatial resolution options and shortens backpropagation paths across 10–30+ layer restoration autoencoders.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Symmetric Mirrored Convolution–Deconvolution Autoencoder with Dense Additive Skips.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">为低剂量 CT、MRI 去噪与残差式重建提供经典深层 encoder-decoder 模板。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">它不显式调用成像 forward operator，像素看似清晰仍可能与原始测量不一致。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Popularized residual encoder–decoder (RED-CNN) architectures as a primary baseline for low-dose CT image-domain denoising.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Historically influential in low-dose CT denoising; purely image-domain L2 training can still over-smooth low-contrast liver lesions.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://papers.nips.cc/paper_files/paper/2016/hash/0ed9422357395a0d4879191c66f4faa2-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Image Restoration Using Very Deep Convolutional Encoder-Decoder Networks with Symmetric Skip Connections</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<span class=\"spec-muted-val\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">未提供官方实现</span><span class=\"lang-en\">No Official Repository</span></span>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
